  from foot of the Vergennes Falls\, down Otter Creek\, and back. Always he
 ld around Halloween\, this race also includes an annual costume contest fo
 r crews\, individuals\, and coaches. This race is free for all to watch an
 d cheer on the participating teams. Join us! Youth rowers register for thi
